        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "extractQuoteIdFromHistory"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1764059996285"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACTQUOTEIDFROMHISTORY",
          "id": "1764007420359",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764007420360_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI that analyzes the full chat history and extracts a single quote identifier.\n\nRequirements:\n\n1. Scan the entire chat history in {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}.\n2. Identify a quote ID referenced in any of the following forms:\n   - quoteId\n   - quote_id\n   - bsid\n   - bs_id\n   - any numeric substring that appears to represent a quote (e.g., “quote 123456789”).\n   - Any string of the format CPQ-### (Example: CPQ-123)\n3. Quote IDs can be numeric strings or of the format CPQ-###.\n4. If multiple IDs appear, return the most recent one in the conversation.\n5. Output pure JSON:\n   {\n   \"quoteId\": \"<extracted_id_or_empty>\",\n   \"quoteIdExists\":true | false\n   }\n6. If no quote ID is present, return an empty string for quoteId and set value of `quoteIdExists` in the response as false.\n\nExtraction Rules:\n\n- Accept direct key/value pairs in JSON-like blocks.\n- Accept IDs mentioned in natural language.\n- Accept IDs embedded in agent responses, summaries, or explanation fields.\n- Disregard anything that is not a numeric identifier.\n\nExample:\nInput chat history contains:\n“Get details of quote 300000010064231” → Output: {\"quoteId\": \"300000010064231\",\"quoteIdExists\":true}\nInput chat history contains:\n\"bs_id\": \"300000010064231\" → Output: {\"quoteId\": \"300000010064231\",\"quoteIdExists\":true}\nInput chat history contains no numeric quote reference or transaction id reference of the format CPQ-### → Output: {\"quoteId\": \"\",\"quoteIdExists\":false}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"quoteIdExists\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"quoteId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "quoteIdExistsInHistory"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1764007792780",
            "false": "1764060205096"
          },
          "code": "QUOTEIDEXISTSINHISTORY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1764061358981",
          "id": "1764059996285",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764059996285_1",
              "name": "condition",
