        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "quoteDetailsFromHistory"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1764061292227"
          },
          "code": "QUOTEDETAILSFROMHISTORY",
          "id": "1764060623945",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764060623946_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You will receive two variables:\n  {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}} → JSON object containing an array\n  {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTQUOTEIDFROMHISTORY.$output.quoteId}} → the target quote ID extracted\n\nYour task is to determine whether the user request {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} can be answered **entirely from information already present in chatHistory** for the given quoteId.\n\nProcess:\n1. **Parse chatHistory strictly as JSON.**\n   Each element has:\n   * `\"role\": \"USER\"` or `\"AI\"`\n   * `\"content\"` which may include deeply nested structures:\n     * `AgentOutput.result[*]`\n     * `AgentOutput.result[*].quoteSummary`\n     * `AgentOutput.result[*].summary`\n     * `AgentOutput.result[*].items`\n     * Any other nested fields\n\n2. **Identify all history records belonging to this quote.**\n   A record matches `quoteId` if *any* of the following fields equal the quote:\n   * `quoteid`\n   * `transactionID`\n   * `transactionID_t`\n   * `bsid` / `bs_id` if associated with that same quote in prior entries\n   * Any nested field clearly referencing the same quote\n\n3. **Extract the user’s current requested attributes.**\n   Determine which specific fields the user wants (e.g., totalContractValue, owner, margin, items, currency, status, dates, or any other explicit detail).\n\n4. **Check availability.**\n   For the given quoteId, check if **all** requested fields already exist anywhere in the matched history records.\n\n5. **Return the result:**\n   * If *all* requested attributes exist → `\"quoteDetailsExists\": true` and `\"quoteData\"` containing only those fields extracted from history.\n   * If *any* requested attribute is missing → `\"quoteDetailsExists\": false` and `\"quoteData\": {}`\n\nOutput format (must be exact):\n{\n  \"quoteDetailsExists\": true | false,\n  \"quoteData\": {}\n}\n\n\nDo not add explanations, reasoning, commentary, or text outside the JSON object."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"quoteData\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {}\n        },\n        \"quoteDetailsExists\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
