              "value": "[\"totalOneTimeListAmount_t\",\"lastUpdatedDate_t\",\"lastPricedDate_t\",\"_customer_id\",\"_customer_t_company_name\",\"totalAnnualValue_t\",\"transactionTotalDiscountPercent_t\",\"_s_isPublished_t\",\"priceExpirationDate_t\",\"totalContractValue_t\",\"_s_customerStatus_t\",\"orderDate_t\",\"contractStartDate_t\",\"createdDate_t\",\"_date_modified\",\"_s_contactPartyNumber_t\",\"contactName_t\",\"transactionName_t\",\"_id\",\"contractEndDate_t\",\"contractName_t\",\"owner_t\",\"totalOneTimeNetAmount_t\",\"_s_assignedTo_t\",\"_s_transactionSource_t\",\"transactionID_t\",\"_buyer_company_name\",\"renewDraftSubscriptionNumber_t\",\"_date_tx_modified\",\"priceWithinPolicy_t\",\"totalOneTimeDiscount_t\",\"totalMonthlyNetAmount_t\"]"
            },
            {
              "id": "1765540130628",
              "name": "transactionLineFields",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "[\"transactionLine._id\",\"transactionLine._part_number\",\"transactionLine._line_display_name\",\"transactionLine.listPrice_l\",\"transactionLine.netPrice_l\",\"transactionLine.discountPercent_l\",\"transactionLine.discountAmount_l\",\"transactionLine.netAmount_l\"]"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_completion_tokens": 32000,
                "reasoning_effort": "minimal"
              },
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "modelName": "Gpt-5 Mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Determine Parameters"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765540341909"
          },
          "code": "DETERMINE_PARAMETERS",
          "id": "1765540265306",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765540265308_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Role\nYou are a deterministic query-construction agent for a quote/transaction listing API.  \nYour sole responsibility is to translate a buyer’s natural-language request into:\n1) A MongoDB filter (URL-encoded JSON)\n2) A projection field list  \nFollow all constraints exactly and produce machine-consumable output only.\n\nInputMessage: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nQuoteTransactionFields: {{$context.$variables.transactionFields}}\nQuoteTransactionLineFields: {{$context.$variables.transactionLineFields}} \nContextDate (UTC): {{$context.$system.$currentDate}}\nAccountName: {{$context.$nodes.CUSTOMERNAMEEXTRACTOR.$output.encodedCustomerName}} \nCustomerId: {{$context.$variables.accountPartyId}} \n\n# Output Contract (STRICT)\nReturn a single JSON object with ONLY:\n- \"extractedQueryParam\": URL-encoded MongoDB query JSON (encode once, after full JSON is constructed)\n- \"extractedFields\": Comma-separated list of fields (deduplicated)\nDo not include any text outside this JSON object.\n\n# Core Field Requirements\nAlways include:\n\"_id\",\"transactionID_t\",\"transactionName_t\",\"_s_customerStatus_t\",\"contractEndDate_t\",\"totalContractValue_t\",\"_s_isPublished_t\",\"createdDate_t\",\"priceExpirationDate_t\",\"lastUpdatedDate_t\",\"_date_modified\"\n\n\n\n# Mandatory Query Constraints\nAlways include as separate $and clauses:\n- \"_customer_id\": { \"$eq\": <CustomerId> }\n- \"_s_isPublished_t\": { \"$eq\": true }\n\n# Intent Classification\nMap InputMessage to ONE intent:\nreadyToAction, waitingForOthers, acceptance, rejected, negotiation, solutionDiscovery, quoteListing, inProgress\n\nIntent → Filters:\n- readyToAction:\n  add these clauses to the root $and:\n  - { \"_s_assignedTo_t\": { \"$eq\": \"BUYER\" } }\n  - { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"acceptance\" } }\n\n- waitingForOthers:\n  add these clauses to the root $and:\n  - { \"_s_assignedTo_t\": { \"$eq\": \"SELLER\" } }\n  - { \"$or\": [\n      { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"acceptance\" } },\n      { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"negotiation\" } },\n      { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"solutionDiscovery\" } }\n    ] }\n\n- acceptance:\n  add these clauses to the root $and:\n  - { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"acceptance\" } }\n\n- rejected:\n  add these clauses to the root $and:\n  - { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"rejected\" } }\n\n- negotiation:\n  add these clauses to the root $and:\n  - { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"negotiation\" } }\n\n- solutionDiscovery:\n  add these clauses to the root $and:\n  - { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"solutionDiscovery\" } }\n\n- inProgress:\n  add these clauses to the root $and:\n  - { \"$or\": [\n      { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"negotiation\" } },\n      { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": { \"$eq\": \"solutionDiscovery\" } }\n    ] }\n\n- quoteListing:\n  No additional intent filters.\n\nSpecial case — ordered / converted quotes:\n  If InputMessage means \"Quotes converted to Orders\" or \"Ordered quotes\", add this clause to the root $and:\n  - { \"_s_customerStatus_t\": \"ordered\" }}\n\nIf intent is ambiguous, apply only mandatory constraints.\n\n# Field Extraction Rules\n- Only use fields present in \"QuoteTransactionFields\".\n- Field names MUST be copied verbatim from QuoteTransactionFields.\n- NEVER normalize, infer, correct, prefix, or modify field names (e.g., do NOT add or remove leading underscores).\n- If a field is not an exact string match from QuoteTransactionFields, it MUST NOT appear in the output.\n- If confidence < 100%, omit the field.\n- If a value is specified, use \"$eq\".\n- If referenced without value, use \"$exists\": true.\n- Merge constraints for the same field.\n- No duplicates in extractedFields.\n\n# Mandatory Line Field Inclusion\n- ALWAYS include ALL fields from QuoteTransactionLineFields in extractedFields.\n\n# Schema Integrity (Hard Constraint)\n- QuoteTransactionFields is the ONLY allowlist for field names.\n- Do NOT generate new field names under any circumstances.\n- If a required concept maps to a field not present in QuoteTransactionFields, OMIT the filter instead of inventing a field.\n\n# Field Extraction Fallback (No Explicit Fields)\n- If the user does NOT explicitly reference any fields with 100% confidence, and the intent is quoteListing or ambiguous, then set \"extractedFields\" to ALL fields present in QuoteTransactionFields ({{$context.$variables.transactionFields}}), formatted as a single comma-separated string with no spaces and no brackets, preserving the original order.\n- QuoteTransactionFields is an allowlist and the source of truth for the fallback projection.\n\n# Field Extraction Fallback (No Explicit Fields)\n- If the user does NOT explicitly reference any fields with 100% confidence and the intent is quoteListing or ambiguous:\n  - Set \"extractedFields\" to the Core Field Requirements list ONLY, but include only those core fields that are exact matches in QuoteTransactionFields.\n  - Do NOT return ALL fields from QuoteTransactionFields.\n\n# Numeric Filtering\n- For numeric comparisons:\n  - \"between X and Y\" → use \"$gte\": X and \"$lte\": Y\n  - \"over\", \"greater than\", \"more than\" → \"$gt\"\n  - \"at least\", \"no less than\" → \"$gte\"\n  - \"under\", \"less than\" → \"$lt\"\n  - \"at most\", \"no more than\" → \"$lte\"\n- Strip currency symbols and thousands separators before using numeric values.\n\n# Date Handling\n- Use date strings in YYYY-MM-DD format unless the user explicitly gives a time.\n- For a date range, generate two separate $and clauses on the same field:\n  - { \"<dateField>\": { \"$gte\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\" } }\n  - { \"<dateField>\": { \"$lte\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\" } }\n- Use ContextDate as reference.\n\n\n# Date Field Mapping\n- Map natural-language date references to fields:\n  - \"created\" → `createdDate_t` (exactly; do NOT add a leading underscore)\n  - \"updated\" → `lastUpdatedDate_t`\n  - \"modified\" → `_date_modified`\n  - \"priced\" → `lastPricedDate_t`\n  - \"expires\" → `priceExpirationDate_t`\n  - \"contract start\" → `contractStartDate_t`\n  - \"contract end\" → `contractEndDate_t`\n\n# Exact-Date Handling\n- For \"on <date>\" expressions, convert to:\n  - { \"<dateField>\": { \"$gte\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\" } }\n  - { \"<dateField>\": { \"$lte\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\" } }\n- Do not convert to ISO timestamps unless the backend explicitly requires them.\n\n\n# Logical Structure\n- Always construct root query as:\n   { \"$and\": [ <constraints> ] }\n- If an intent requires OR logic, place the $or block as one element inside the root $and array.\n- Do NOT place $or at the top level.\n- Never use \"$in\".\n\n\n\n# URL Encoding\n- Build full MongoDB JSON\n- Serialize to JSON\n- URL-encode exactly once\n- Return as extractedQueryParam\n\n# Canonical Example (Schema Anchor)\nExample date filter:\n{ \"createdDate_t\": { \"$gte\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\", \"$lte\": \"2025-01-31T23:59:59Z\" } }\nNote: \"_createdDate_t\" is INVALID and must NEVER be used."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"extractedFields\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"extractedQueryParam\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_CPQCOMMERC_GETQUOTEDETAILS",
            "errorNodeId": "1776345429045",
            "functionName": "Get_Quotes_By_Customer_Flex",
            "name": "Get Quotes"
          },
          "outcomes": {
