        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Clean Quote Data",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let listQuotes = $context.$nodes.GET_QUOTES.$output;\n\nconst cleaned = JSON.parse(\n  JSON.stringify(listQuotes),\n  (key, value) => {\n    // Remove links (existing logic)\n    if (key === \"links\") return undefined;\n\n    return value;\n  }\n);\n\n// --- Post-process to remove price fields ---\nif (Array.isArray(cleaned?.items)) {\n  cleaned.items = cleaned.items.map((item) => {\n    const status = item?._s_customerStatus_t?.value;\n\n    if (status === \"solutionDiscovery\" || status === \"negotiation\") {\n      // Remove price-related fields at header level\n      delete item.totalContractValue_t;\n      delete item.totalContractListValue_t;\n      delete item.totalContractDiscount_t;\n      delete item.totalAnnualValue_t;\n      delete item.totalOneTimeNetAmount_t;\n      delete item.transactionTotalDiscountPercent_t;\n      delete item.totalOneTimeNetAmount_t;\n      delete item.totalContractValue_t;\n      delete item.totalAnnualValue_t;\n\n      // Remove price fields inside line items\n      if (Array.isArray(item?.transactionLine?.items)) {\n        item.transactionLine.items = item.transactionLine.items.map((line) => {\n          delete line.netAmount_l;\n          delete line.netPrice_l;\n          delete line.listPrice_l;\n          delete line.listAmount_l;\n          delete line.discountAmount_l;\n          delete line.discountPercent_l;\n          delete line.unitMargin_l;\n          delete line._price_unit_price_each;\n          delete line.contractMargin_l;\n          delete line.nonRecurRevRollup_l;\n          delete line.contractValue_l;\n          delete line.netAmountRollup_l;\n          delete line.contractListValueRollup_l;\n          delete line.contractListValue_l;\n          delete line._runningUnitPrice;\n          delete line.listPriceRollup_l;\n          delete line.contractListValueRollup_l;\n          delete line.contractValueRollup_l;\n          delete line.netPriceRollup_l;\n          delete line.marginAmount_l;\n          delete line.marginPercent_l;\n          delete line.annualListValue_l;\n          delete line.annualValue_l;\n          delete line.annualMargin_l;\n          delete line.contractDiscount_l;\n          delete line.contractCost_l;\n          delete line.costAmount_l;\n          delete line.unitCost_l;\n          delete line.listAmount_l;\n          delete line.unitMargin_l;\n          delete line.discountAmount_l;\n          delete line.customDiscountAmount_l;\n          delete line.customDiscountValue_l;\n          delete line._pricing_rule_price_each;\n          delete line._price_configurable_price;\n          delete line._price_unit_price_each;\n          delete line._price_item_price_each;\n          delete line._part_base_price;\n          delete line._part_default_price_type;\n          return line;\n        });\n      }\n    }\n\n    return item;\n  });\n}\n\nreturn cleaned;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775040963193"
          },
          "code": "CLEAN_QUOTE_DATA",
          "id": "1765548305998",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Quote Id Extractor"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1766757252902"
          },
          "code": "QUOTE_ID_EXTRACTOR",
          "id": "1766580580807",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766580580808_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract and return the value of bsid from {{$context.$nodes.QUOTE_GENERATION.$output.output}}\nIf bsid value is not present, return null"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "quoteRequestDetailsValidator"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1763121396695"
          },
          "code": "QUOTEREQUESTDETAILSVALIDATOR",
          "id": "1766742664725",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766742664727_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Role:\nAct as an information-extraction engine. Detect the presence of required fields and extract their values when available. Do not infer missing information.\n\nTask:\nFrom the user request {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}, identify and extract the following fields:\n- product_name\n- product_quantity\n- documentTrackerId\n\nRules:\n1. Check for the presence of  product_name, product_quantity and documentTrackerId.\n2. For product_name and product_quantity, there may be multiple instances. If multiple products and quantities are found, treat them as a list of values.\n3. For each field, return:\n   - A boolean flag indicating whether the field is present.\n   - The extracted value(s) for each field, or null if absent.\n   - For multiple instances of product_name and product_quantity, return the values as arrays.\n4. Extract the value of documentTrackerId from {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} only if the user explicitly mentions\na document-related tracking concept using keywords such as: \"document\", \"tracker\", \"tracking\", \"reference\", or \"request\".\n    - Do NOT extract documentTrackerId from product identifiers, SKUs, or item codes unless accompanied by those keywords.\n    - Do not generate or infer an identifier that is not written.\n    - If a value is clearly associated with a product_name, it must not be reused as documentTrackerId.\n5. If documentTrackerId is present:\n   - Set documentTrackerId_present to true.\n   - Set product_name_present and product_quantity_present to true.\n6. Do not generate or guess values.\n7. Product quantity limit check:\n   - If product_quantity is present and contains one or more numeric values,  compare each numeric quantity against the maximum allowed value of 20.\n   - If ANY extracted product_quantity value is greater than 20, set product_qty_exceeded = true.\n   - Otherwise, set product_qty_exceeded = false.\n   - If product_quantity is not present or no numeric value is explicitly stated, set product_qty_exceeded = false.\n   - Do NOT infer quantities from context, product names, or defaults.\n\nOutput format (only this JSON):\n{\n  \"product_name_present\": true|false,\n  \"product_name\": [\"<value1>\", \"<value2>\", ...] | \"<value or null>\",\n  \"product_qty_exceeded\": true|false,\n  \"product_quantity_present\": true|false,\n  \"product_quantity\": [\"<value1>\", \"<value2>\", ...] | \"<value or null>\",\n  \"documentTrackerId\": \"<value or null>\",\n  \"documentTrackerId_present\": true|false\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
