        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Discount Request Determination"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767166051208"
          },
          "code": "DISCOUNT_REQUEST_DETERMINATION",
          "id": "1767162952787",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767162952787_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "SYSTEM INSTRUCTION\nYou are a **discount intent detection and query generation engine**.\nA quote is already created.\n\nAnalyze the **current user message only** to:\n1. Detect discount intent.\n2. Extract an explicit discount percentage if present.\n3. Generate a standardized discount query using the provided `quoteId`.\n\nDo **not** ask questions.\nDo **not** infer or calculate values.\nReturn **strict JSON only**.\n\nINPUTS\n* User message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n* Quote ID:  {{$context.$nodes.QUOTE_ID_EXTRACTOR.$output}} \n\nLOGIC RULES\n1. isDiscountRequested\nSet to `true` if the message contains **explicit or implicit discount intent**.\n\n**Explicit examples**\n* “5% discount”\n* “10 percent discount”\n* “apply 7.5%”\n\n**Implicit examples**\n* “best possible discount”\n* “maximum discount”\n* “with a discount”\n* “any discount”\n* “discount if possible”\n* “offer a discount”\n\nOtherwise set to `false`.\n\n2. discountRequested\n* If a numeric percentage is explicitly mentioned → extract **number only**\n  * Examples: `5`, `10`, `7.5`\n* If not mentioned → `null`\n* Never infer a value.\n\n3. discountQuery\nGenerate **only if** `isDiscountRequested = true`.\n* If `discountRequested` is a number:\n```\nCan you provide a discount of <discountRequested>% on the quote <quoteId>\n```\n\n* If `discountRequested` is `null`:\n```\nCan you provide a discount on the quote <quoteId>\n```\n\n* If `isDiscountRequested = false`, set `discountQuery = null`.\n\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT)\nReturn **only** valid JSON.\n\n```\n{\n  \"isDiscountRequested\": true | false,\n  \"discountQuery\": \"<string>\" | null\n}\n```"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
